{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のオフショット ◡̈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/20/9006757/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/20/9006757/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにこれ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/20/9006757/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはなんだったんだろう。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うたコンの待ち時間、\n何かを見つけた北野と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな北野に全く気付かない\nポーズの変化のない1期生でした(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日書いたと思ったら\n書いてなかったので..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のNOGIBINGO!7での、メール選手権、\nワースト1位でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかのワースト1位(  ˟_˟  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構自信持ってた自分が怖い(  ˟_˟  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空白開けるのはダメなんだね(  ˟_˟  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知りませんでした(  ˟_˟  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうネットは信じないぞ〜。\n鵜呑みにしないぞ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、脅迫文じゃないからね( •̅_•̅ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( •̅_•̅ )。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「A Whole New World」平井大さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アラジンの曲のカバーなのですが\nカバーとは思えないほどの完成度と\n独特の世界観、雰囲気が\nとても好き。\n少し爽やかな感じもするし\n声が甘めなのでロマンチック。\nずっと聞いていたい歌です。\n他のディズニーカバーの曲も\n沢山聞いています！\nCDを買ったので家の車でも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/20/9006757/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沢山のコメントがとても嬉しかったです！\n地上波の力は凄い...！と\n改めて感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組出る時は見る！！\nと言ってくださったので\nまたそんな機会があればいいなと願うばかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気長に待ってくれたら嬉しいです( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}